1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,113
This is Asha. Tomorrow, her whole team meets.

2
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:12,233
Ravi joins in Telugu. Meher joins in Punjabi.

3
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:19,620
नमस्ते। कल की बैठक के लिए शाम चार बजे कमरा तीन में बारह नीली फाइलें लाना।
[Hindi] Hello. Bring twelve blue files to room three at four tomorrow for the meeting.

4
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:27,382
Room four, not three. Everyone needs the update.

5
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:32,020
నాలుగో గది, మూడో గది కాదు.
[Telugu] Room four, not room three.

6
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:35,080
ਕਮਰਾ ਚਾਰ, ਕਮਰਾ ਤਿੰਨ ਨਹੀਂ।
[Punjabi] Room four, not room three.

7
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:44,105
Ravi confirms. Then Meher. The update needs fresh confirmation.

8
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:51,243
When they leave, the message and confirmations stay together in a bilingual recap.

9
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:58,748
Charcha. Different languages. One shared plan.
